      "message": "I wonder if we can make up some format to transmit \u003e 256 bytes, while keeping compatibility.\n\nMaybe something like this: if bit 7 of rd count is set, then there is a second rd count byte right afterwards, e.g.:\n\n     +----------+-----------+---------------+---------------+----------------+\n     | port: 1B | addr: 1B  | wr count : 1B | rd count : 1B |  rd count2 : 1B |\n     +----------+-----------+---------------+---------------+----------------+\n\nAnd then the length is (rd count \u0026 0x7f) | (rd count2 \u003c\u003c 7).",
